(4792083, 691689, 92296, '<td valign="top">Some poeple, no matter what the challenge, always take a picture of a horse and i give them 4 or 5.  Some people, no matter what the challenge, always find a way of taking a great shot of a beautiful woman and I give them 9.  Go figure.</td>', 'Some poeple, no matter what the challenge, always take a picture of a horse and i give them 4 or 5.  Some people, no matter what the challenge, always find a way of taking a great shot of a beautiful woman and I give them 9.  Go figure.', '2008-06-30 18:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
