(4792220, 693020, 19708, '<td valign="top">Maybe not as attractive as a store-bought one, but is certainly a good way to recycle. Nice colors/levels on this. The one oof leaf is a bit distracting, and I''m sure that given another opportunity, you would have snipped or pulled it out of the way, or perhaps used a stop or two down to get it a little clearer, yet still maintain the oof nature of it.</td>', 'Maybe not as attractive as a store-bought one, but is certainly a good way to recycle. Nice colors/levels on this. The one oof leaf is a bit distracting, and I''m sure that given another opportunity, you would have snipped or pulled it out of the way, or perhaps used a stop or two down to get it a little clearer, yet still maintain the oof nature of it.', '2008-06-30 19:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792221, 693056, 19708, '<td valign="top">Oye. Not a planter I''d want in my yard.<br/>Good take on this challenge, and the composition and levels/tones here work well.</td>', 'Oye. Not a planter I''d want in my yard.Good take on this challenge, and the composition and levels/tones here work well.', '2008-06-30 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
