(4792226, 692541, 19708, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this is a real stretch to fit into this challenge in my opinion. The post-processing is hurting this in my opinion, as the nature of the editing left the background around the Howdy-Doody muddy &amp; distracting.</td>', 'Without the title, this is a real stretch to fit into this challenge in my opinion. The post-processing is hurting this in my opinion, as the nature of the editing left the background around the Howdy-Doody muddy & distracting.', '2008-06-30 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
