(4792234, 692509, 19708, '<td valign="top">Swap meet? That would certainly qualify as a great way to recycle/re-use. The post-processing here is killing this shot in my opinion. I know you wanted the green to stand out in this, but it really came out odd.</td>', 'Swap meet? That would certainly qualify as a great way to recycle/re-use. The post-processing here is killing this shot in my opinion. I know you wanted the green to stand out in this, but it really came out odd.', '2008-06-30 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
