(4796952, 693091, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image here. Not sure of the connection to the challenge though. I do find it interesting that the other image in blue is exact same title, exact same pic in the light bulb challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting image here. Not sure of the connection to the challenge though. I do find it interesting that the other image in blue is exact same title, exact same pic in the light bulb challenge.', '2008-07-02 02:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
