(4798018, 691937, 90829, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. I really like the angle on this shot and the touch of grass in the corner. Well Done. 7</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. I really like the angle on this shot and the touch of grass in the corner. Well Done. 7', '2008-07-02 11:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798189, 693113, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great concept and well executed shot.  Nice sharp focus on the plant.  I think the main thing that would make this more DPC friendly and crank the score up would be to clean up the background.  The same exact plant/jar subject against a pure white background would probably get you .5 to a full point higher.</td>', 'Great concept and well executed shot.  Nice sharp focus on the plant.  I think the main thing that would make this more DPC friendly and crank the score up would be to clean up the background.  The same exact plant/jar subject against a pure white background would probably get you .5 to a full point higher.', '2008-07-02 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798208, 693137, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the rule of thirds.  The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It''s simple, but all of the elements just work so well together.  The little bit of green land, the stripes on the windmill, even the perfectly puffy clouds.</td>', 'Nice use of the rule of thirds.  The more I look at this, the more I like it.  It''s simple, but all of the elements just work so well together.  The little bit of green land, the stripes on the windmill, even the perfectly puffy clouds.', '2008-07-02 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798216, 692661, 52500, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image, but the only thing that ties it to the challenge is the title.  You could take the same shot at a national chain grocery store.  Still, the sentiment is noble and I like the shot, so a 6 you get.</td>', 'It''s a nice image, but the only thing that ties it to the challenge is the title.  You could take the same shot at a national chain grocery store.  Still, the sentiment is noble and I like the shot, so a 6 you get.', '2008-07-02 12:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798225, 692562, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nothin'' like a cheesy title!  The 2 ?? really make it pop.  I like the idea and the green, but I wish it was sharper.</td>', 'Nothin'' like a cheesy title!  The 2 ?? really make it pop.  I like the idea and the green, but I wish it was sharper.', '2008-07-02 12:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798234, 692952, 52500, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  Looks good.  The grayish brown of the background isn''t very inviting to me, but it looks great technically.  The whole thing feels like it is tilted to the right just a bit.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  Looks good.  The grayish brown of the background isn''t very inviting to me, but it looks great technically.  The whole thing feels like it is tilted to the right just a bit.', '2008-07-02 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798243, 692424, 52500, '<td valign="top">Recycling in action.  I like the B/W for the most part.  The bottle looks great, the bin lid looks kinda blah.  It''s all super sharp which looks nice.</td>', 'Recycling in action.  I like the B/W for the most part.  The bottle looks great, the bin lid looks kinda blah.  It''s all super sharp which looks nice.', '2008-07-02 12:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798266, 691895, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I would imagine it''s scoring pretty well.  I would have changed a couple of things.  I would prefer the center of the leaf to be closer to the thirds line, the recycle symbol seems a bit overpowering (a bit smaller perhaps), and it tilts to the right a ways.  You get a 7 from me.  With those changes, it could have been best in show.</td>', 'Great idea, and I would imagine it''s scoring pretty well.  I would have changed a couple of things.  I would prefer the center of the leaf to be closer to the thirds line, the recycle symbol seems a bit overpowering (a bit smaller perhaps), and it tilts to the right a ways.  You get a 7 from me.  With those changes, it could have been best in show.', '2008-07-02 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798281, 692574, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  I love the HDR look.  Simplicity combined with absurdity.  Just awesome.</td>', 'This is fantastic.  I love the HDR look.  Simplicity combined with absurdity.  Just awesome.', '2008-07-02 12:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798286, 693303, 52500, '<td valign="top">Hybrids are green, and you have documented the nameplate successfully, but it isn''t really that exciting as a photo.  I would guess that it works better in color as well.</td>', 'Hybrids are green, and you have documented the nameplate successfully, but it isn''t really that exciting as a photo.  I would guess that it works better in color as well.', '2008-07-02 12:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798296, 692803, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice composition.  Something about it I can only describe as murky.  I can''t really put my finger on it.  Maybe it needs more color contrast?</td>', 'Great idea, nice composition.  Something about it I can only describe as murky.  I can''t really put my finger on it.  Maybe it needs more color contrast?', '2008-07-02 12:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798302, 692278, 52500, '<td valign="top">There is a store in Albuquerque called Earth Shoe.  I don''t know if it exists elsewhere or if your title is related to the store in any way.  I just thought that was interesting.  Anyway, I like the idea, and the photo itself looks pretty good.  I don''t like the end of the lace just peeking out from under the shoe.  I think I might prefer to see the whole shoe as well, maybe from a little lower angle.</td>', 'There is a store in Albuquerque called Earth Shoe.  I don''t know if it exists elsewhere or if your title is related to the store in any way.  I just thought that was interesting.  Anyway, I like the idea, and the photo itself looks pretty good.  I don''t like the end of the lace just peeking out from under the shoe.  I think I might prefer to see the whole shoe as well, maybe from a little lower angle.', '2008-07-02 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798306, 692111, 52500, '<td valign="top">Light bulbs are fun!  I wonder if Langdon knew there would be a bunch in this challenge and that''s part of why he made the 24 hour challenge as well (just to mess with you guys).  Anyway, shot looks great.  Nice and sharp, good contrast between the bulbs.  I recommend using the full 720x720 next time for added impact.</td>', 'Light bulbs are fun!  I wonder if Langdon knew there would be a bunch in this challenge and that''s part of why he made the 24 hour challenge as well (just to mess with you guys).  Anyway, shot looks great.  Nice and sharp, good contrast between the bulbs.  I recommend using the full 720x720 next time for added impact.', '2008-07-02 12:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
