(4799037, 692982, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice shot in general.  The green cup annoys me a bit, as it doesn''t seem to belong.  The border also annoys me a lot.  Still a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot in general.  The green cup annoys me a bit, as it doesn''t seem to belong.  The border also annoys me a lot.  Still a 6 from me.', '2008-07-02 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799049, 692559, 52500, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Dirty hands holding something almost always look good, and this is no exception.  The acidic processing looks great too.  Of course, I''m an acid junkie (just the processing style though).  I would have preferred a baby tree instead of the flower for maximum "Green" effect, and the flower looks fake (even though I doubt it is).  It also looks like the subject took his/her watch off right before the shoot.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Dirty hands holding something almost always look good, and this is no exception.  The acidic processing looks great too.  Of course, I''m an acid junkie (just the processing style though).  I would have preferred a baby tree instead of the flower for maximum "Green" effect, and the flower looks fake (even though I doubt it is).  It also looks like the subject took his/her watch off right before the shoot.', '2008-07-02 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799105, 692790, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and processing but the composition seems to be off for some reason. Good shot!</td>', 'Nice clarity and processing but the composition seems to be off for some reason. Good shot!', '2008-07-02 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799111, 693123, 22970, '<td valign="top">Well I see you must have a Canon 40D by looking at the charger :)<br/>Good focus and lighting; meets the challenge. Good shot!</td>', 'Well I see you must have a Canon 40D by looking at the charger :)Good focus and lighting; meets the challenge. Good shot!', '2008-07-02 17:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799112, 692508, 22970, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and processing.</td>', 'Interesting shot and processing.', '2008-07-02 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799115, 693318, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The colors are great but the border (white line) is a bit distracting. Good shot!</td>', 'Nice capture. The colors are great but the border (white line) is a bit distracting. Good shot!', '2008-07-02 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799124, 693315, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good concept and lighting is great. The composition bothers me a bit. Could a slight tilt to the right been better? Good Shot!</td>', 'Good concept and lighting is great. The composition bothers me a bit. Could a slight tilt to the right been better? Good Shot!', '2008-07-02 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799134, 692509, 22970, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting with its bumped up saturation on the outside. I see where your going with this shot. The inside of the border processing is good. I like the way you lowered the saturation, except the green, to emphasize and add an element. Good focus but seems more of a snapshot than a though out photograph. With that said your lighting is good along with dof.</td>', 'The border is distracting with its bumped up saturation on the outside. I see where your going with this shot. The inside of the border processing is good. I like the way you lowered the saturation, except the green, to emphasize and add an element. Good focus but seems more of a snapshot than a though out photograph. With that said your lighting is good along with dof.', '2008-07-02 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799139, 692760, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good shot even though a bit busy. I think the saturation is a bit to high and you could of processed the image to focus more on the sign and items. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Good shot even though a bit busy. I think the saturation is a bit to high and you could of processed the image to focus more on the sign and items. Still a good shot.', '2008-07-02 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799143, 691895, 22970, '<td valign="top">OK, I have not been through the complete challenge yet but this has to be my favorite so far. Very good focus, lighting, composition, and idea. I could see this being in a ad or on a poster to promote recycling. <strike>Good</strike> Great Job!</td>', 'OK, I have not been through the complete challenge yet but this has to be my favorite so far. Very good focus, lighting, composition, and idea. I could see this being in a ad or on a poster to promote recycling. Good Great Job!', '2008-07-02 17:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
