(4799528, 693038, 90658, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that you are attempting to show that this purse is woven with recycled material.  However, from this angle and the tightness of the shot, I would never have guessed it was a purse without the title.</td>', 'I appreciate that you are attempting to show that this purse is woven with recycled material.  However, from this angle and the tightness of the shot, I would never have guessed it was a purse without the title.', '2008-07-02 19:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
