(4800933, 692967, 41357, '<td valign="top">You have 9 footsteps in the picture which I assume symbolise <br/>The nine openings in a male Human body according to Islam. <br/>but did you know that the number nine is also: <br/>The nine nodes of the bamboo for the Taoists<br/>but most important:<br/>The nine Choruses of the Angels: Seraphes, angels of love and light; Cherubs, angels of wisdom and intelligence; Thrones, angels of force and life; Dominations, angels of liberty; Principalities, angels of eternity and memory; Powers, angels of holiness; Vertues, angels of humility; Archangels, having for attribute the justice; Ordinary angels, to which we attribute the innocence.<br/>Then there is the nine months of pregnancy which are the most beautiful in a woman life, and the most horrid for man.<br/> <br/>I hope this comment is useful and will help improve your photography</td>', 'You have 9 footsteps in the picture which I assume symbolise The nine openings in a male Human body according to Islam. but did you know that the number nine is also: The nine nodes of the bamboo for the Taoistsbut most important:The nine Choruses of the Angels: Seraphes, angels of love and light; Cherubs, angels of wisdom and intelligence; Thrones, angels of force and life; Dominations, angels of liberty; Principalities, angels of eternity and memory; Powers, angels of holiness; Vertues, angels of humility; Archangels, having for attribute the justice; Ordinary angels, to which we attribute the innocence.Then there is the nine months of pregnancy which are the most beautiful in a woman life, and the most horrid for man. I hope this comment is useful and will help improve your photography', '2008-07-03 12:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
