(4801033, 692967, 90658, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hilarious!  The reflection in the car window demands more attention than it should.  It was almost an afterthought to get to the footprints.  Without the title, I might have focused only on the rust stain above the prints and the reflection.</td>', 'Absolutely hilarious!  The reflection in the car window demands more attention than it should.  It was almost an afterthought to get to the footprints.  Without the title, I might have focused only on the rust stain above the prints and the reflection.', '2008-07-03 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
