(4801038, 693003, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting editorial concept.  I think you might have way too much color going on.  Perhaps an umbrella that is more atonal, I like the bright color, but there is alot to look at.</td>', 'Interesting editorial concept.  I think you might have way too much color going on.  Perhaps an umbrella that is more atonal, I like the bright color, but there is alot to look at.', '2008-07-03 13:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
