(4802304, 693315, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good lighting here, though just a tad harsh, and maybe it''s just me, but seems a bit odd being so dead-center, though I''m not sure what to suggest otherwise.<br/>Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good lighting here, though just a tad harsh, and maybe it''s just me, but seems a bit odd being so dead-center, though I''m not sure what to suggest otherwise.Good take on the challenge.', '2008-07-04 05:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802305, 692559, 19708, '<td valign="top">Though I''ve seen this same/similar shot before, it''s well done and a good take on this challenge.<br/>Not sure I''m a huge fan of the acid toning here, maybe a darker hue of earth tones would be richer, almost a draganized style to grunge it some without the acid tones. Personal preference only. High marks.</td>', 'Though I''ve seen this same/similar shot before, it''s well done and a good take on this challenge.Not sure I''m a huge fan of the acid toning here, maybe a darker hue of earth tones would be richer, almost a draganized style to grunge it some without the acid tones. Personal preference only. High marks.', '2008-07-04 05:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802310, 693289, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.<br/>Overall seems odd with the perspective or tilt here, skewed to leaning to the right. In Photoshop, try this: Cntl-A to select all, Edit, Transform, Skew, then grab the lower right corner and drag it to the right some, then grab the top left and drag it to the left some - play with it until it looks more lined up right without leaning, then flatten the layers. This will make it so you don''t have to re-crop if the image was simply rotated.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.Overall seems odd with the perspective or tilt here, skewed to leaning to the right. In Photoshop, try this: Cntl-A to select all, Edit, Transform, Skew, then grab the lower right corner and drag it to the right some, then grab the top left and drag it to the left some - play with it until it looks more lined up right without leaning, then flatten the layers. This will make it so you don''t have to re-crop if the image was simply rotated.Good luck!', '2008-07-04 05:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802311, 693283, 19708, '<td valign="top">Without the title here, one wouldn''t really understand what they were looking at here in my opinion. The lighting, depth of field and overall tones look great. I just have no idea what it is without the the title.</td>', 'Without the title here, one wouldn''t really understand what they were looking at here in my opinion. The lighting, depth of field and overall tones look great. I just have no idea what it is without the the title.', '2008-07-04 05:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802313, 693243, 19708, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t really understand how this fits the reuse, recycle theme. If using public transportation is it, then I guess I do, but without the title, this really is out of the box in a way.<br/>Very nice shot and a great choice for b&amp;w.<br/>I''m leaning to thinking out of the box and as I commute away from this image, do so leaving high marks behind.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t really understand how this fits the reuse, recycle theme. If using public transportation is it, then I guess I do, but without the title, this really is out of the box in a way.Very nice shot and a great choice for b&w.I''m leaning to thinking out of the box and as I commute away from this image, do so leaving high marks behind.Good luck.', '2008-07-04 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802315, 692971, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image here, great lighting, and smiling faces always a plus with me.<br/>For once, a border like this works with the image rather than against it as is usually the case in colored borders, though I never vote on the border.<br/>Good luck on this one.</td>', 'Nice clear image here, great lighting, and smiling faces always a plus with me.For once, a border like this works with the image rather than against it as is usually the case in colored borders, though I never vote on the border.Good luck on this one.', '2008-07-04 06:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802317, 691689, 95442, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2008-07-04 06:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802318, 693316, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.<br/>Let''s use less electricity for our lights, but so many would simply toss this in the trash, adding mercury to the landfills. Wise choice huh.<br/>Nice point of view here and the cool toning works well for this. Not really exciting as a subject, but you made a dull subject far more appealing.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.Let''s use less electricity for our lights, but so many would simply toss this in the trash, adding mercury to the landfills. Wise choice huh.Nice point of view here and the cool toning works well for this. Not really exciting as a subject, but you made a dull subject far more appealing.Good luck!', '2008-07-04 06:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802320, 693047, 19708, '<td valign="top">Fun image here and well isolated from the background by the depth of field.<br/>One problem though. I don''t see the connection to the challenge.<br/>Remove the title and it doesn''t stand a chance, which a good image should be able to stand on it''s own, without explanations or saying why it should fit a challenge.</td>', 'Fun image here and well isolated from the background by the depth of field.One problem though. I don''t see the connection to the challenge.Remove the title and it doesn''t stand a chance, which a good image should be able to stand on it''s own, without explanations or saying why it should fit a challenge.', '2008-07-04 06:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802321, 693109, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lighting here, though I know they did the lighting for you *grin*<br/>Well seen and a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice tones and lighting here, though I know they did the lighting for you *grin*Well seen and a good take on the challenge.', '2008-07-04 06:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802324, 693296, 19708, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and good take on the challenge.<br/>I think if the lighting could be a little more even or subdued in the center and just a touch lighter in the outside section <i>(easily done with shadow/highlight tool in PS)</i>, this would have much better appeal and overall score/results.<br/>Good luck on this one.</td>', 'Clever idea and good take on the challenge.I think if the lighting could be a little more even or subdued in the center and just a touch lighter in the outside section (easily done with shadow/highlight tool in PS), this would have much better appeal and overall score/results.Good luck on this one.', '2008-07-04 06:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802326, 693274, 19708, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see the connection to the challenge in this and suspect you used the color green as the theme, and I''m sure you already heard it all about the challenge not being about the color.<br/>Cherish this shot though  - that''s far more important than a score here.</td>', 'I really don''t see the connection to the challenge in this and suspect you used the color green as the theme, and I''m sure you already heard it all about the challenge not being about the color.Cherish this shot though  - that''s far more important than a score here.', '2008-07-04 06:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802328, 691148, 19708, '<td valign="top">Fitting to the challenge, but doesn''t not really appear to very thought out, is out of focus and noisy. Was this shot with a cell phone perhaps? I see no camera make/model in your exif data.</td>', 'Fitting to the challenge, but doesn''t not really appear to very thought out, is out of focus and noisy. Was this shot with a cell phone perhaps? I see no camera make/model in your exif data.', '2008-07-04 06:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802329, 692792, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image, but really do not see how it fits the challenge.<br/>Remove the title and it really has no connection to recycling, re using, etc.<br/>Nice landscape shot - that I have to give you.</td>', 'This is a stunning image, but really do not see how it fits the challenge.Remove the title and it really has no connection to recycling, re using, etc.Nice landscape shot - that I have to give you.', '2008-07-04 06:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802340, 693171, 19708, '<td valign="top">OK, I had to go Google it to see what you saw in submitting this.<br/>Biodegradable, vegetable-based, Certified Fair Trade &amp; Organic Oils, etc.<br/>I doubt many will to the trouble to find out how this fits in the challenge and  would be willing to bet you are receiving a number of low votes because of it.</td>', 'OK, I had to go Google it to see what you saw in submitting this.Biodegradable, vegetable-based, Certified Fair Trade & Organic Oils, etc.I doubt many will to the trouble to find out how this fits in the challenge and  would be willing to bet you are receiving a number of low votes because of it.', '2008-07-04 06:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802345, 692598, 19708, '<td valign="top">I am at a loss to understand how this fits the theme of recycling, re using , etc.<br/>Remove the title and the image doesn''t really have any connection to the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'I am at a loss to understand how this fits the theme of recycling, re using , etc.Remove the title and the image doesn''t really have any connection to the challenge in my opinion.', '2008-07-04 06:44:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4802351, 691840, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice image here, but an image really should stand on it''s own to fit the theme of the challenge, without a title. The viewer/voter has no way to know what is any different about that water. Perhaps if a sign was in the shot or something similar, then it would tell the story. As it is, without the title, It''s just a nice shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge.<br/>On a side note, it looks like maybe a touch too much noise reduction was used, as seen in the feathers - they lack detail/texture.</td>', 'Nice image here, but an image really should stand on it''s own to fit the theme of the challenge, without a title. The viewer/voter has no way to know what is any different about that water. Perhaps if a sign was in the shot or something similar, then it would tell the story. As it is, without the title, It''s just a nice shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge.On a side note, it looks like maybe a touch too much noise reduction was used, as seen in the feathers - they lack detail/texture.', '2008-07-04 06:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802365, 693300, 19708, '<td valign="top">Like a circle in a spiral<br/>Like a wheel within a wheel<br/>Never ending or beginning<br/>On an ever-spinning reel<br/>As the images unwind<br/>Like the circles that you find<br/>In the windmills of your mind<br/> <br/>Good take on this challenge.<br/>Composition overall good, with a nice foreground, subject and sky. Had this been cropped to remove the nice foreground, this wouldn''t have nearly the impact &amp; balance that it does have as it is now.</td>', 'Like a circle in a spiralLike a wheel within a wheelNever ending or beginningOn an ever-spinning reelAs the images unwindLike the circles that you findIn the windmills of your mind Good take on this challenge.Composition overall good, with a nice foreground, subject and sky. Had this been cropped to remove the nice foreground, this wouldn''t have nearly the impact & balance that it does have as it is now.', '2008-07-04 06:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4802369, 692263, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great take on this challenge.<br/>I really like everything about this with the exception of the border, but no worries, I don''t vote on borders.<br/>High marks here.</td>', 'Great take on this challenge.I really like everything about this with the exception of the border, but no worries, I don''t vote on borders.High marks here.', '2008-07-04 06:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
