(4802665, 691148, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image has a few issues.  It meets the challenge, but it isn''t well focused at all.  Also there is a huge amount of graininess which makes the image very distracting and muddy.  Noise reduction could have helped, and a tripod if you hand held the camera at a slow shutter speed.</td>', 'Image has a few issues.  It meets the challenge, but it isn''t well focused at all.  Also there is a huge amount of graininess which makes the image very distracting and muddy.  Noise reduction could have helped, and a tripod if you hand held the camera at a slow shutter speed.', '2008-07-04 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
