(4806439, 693275, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice image here, but an image really should stand on it''s own to fit the theme of the challenge, without a title, and if you were going for the color green, then it''s way off mark to fit the challenge.</td>', 'Nice image here, but an image really should stand on it''s own to fit the theme of the challenge, without a title, and if you were going for the color green, then it''s way off mark to fit the challenge.', '2008-07-06 04:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
