(4807169, 693211, 22970, '<td valign="top"><strike>As-is your shot looks more like a snapshot, sorry.</strike> A little more creativity would have made the photo score higher IMO. Such as adding an element of someone placing recyclables into the dumpster and a different POV. Wish you well in the challenge.<br/> <br/><b>EDIT to ADD:</b> Photographer pm''ed me after the challenge and asked in a kind manner why I felt like this photo looked like a snapshot. I defended my comment and we had a nice dialogue with each other. I have looked at this photo throughout today studying everything and have come to the conclusion that it does NOT warrant being classified as a snapshot. <br/> <br/>I apologize if I offended the photograph with my statement. The remainder of my comment I still standby.<br/> <br/>Blackbox thank for the PM you sent and hope you accept my apology. You are a good photographer and it was nice speaking with you through PM.<br/> <br/>Scott<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-07 19:15:59.</i></td>', 'As-is your shot looks more like a snapshot, sorry. A little more creativity would have made the photo score higher IMO. Such as adding an element of someone placing recyclables into the dumpster and a different POV. Wish you well in the challenge. EDIT to ADD: Photographer pm''ed me after the challenge and asked in a kind manner why I felt like this photo looked like a snapshot. I defended my comment and we had a nice dialogue with each other. I have looked at this photo throughout today studying everything and have come to the conclusion that it does NOT warrant being classified as a snapshot.  I apologize if I offended the photograph with my statement. The remainder of my comment I still standby. Blackbox thank for the PM you sent and hope you accept my apology. You are a good photographer and it was nice speaking with you through PM. Scott', '2008-07-06 16:54:33.000000', '2008-07-07 20:15:59.000000', 1),
