(4807650, 692834, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting take by illustrating the opposite. A decent snapshot, but I''m afraid it doesn''t stand out. Might do a bit better in a vehicles challenge, I think.</td>', 'An interesting take by illustrating the opposite. A decent snapshot, but I''m afraid it doesn''t stand out. Might do a bit better in a vehicles challenge, I think.', '2008-07-06 21:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
