(4807725, 692562, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and meets the challenge. The green border is a bit much. I think this photograph would have benefited without a border as it shows the tilt of the right side of the bulb. Clever title.</td>', 'Nice colors and meets the challenge. The green border is a bit much. I think this photograph would have benefited without a border as it shows the tilt of the right side of the bulb. Clever title.', '2008-07-06 21:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807727, 692721, 22970, '<td valign="top">A tad busy for my taste but interesting nevertheless. Exposure and lighting good.</td>', 'A tad busy for my taste but interesting nevertheless. Exposure and lighting good.', '2008-07-06 21:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807736, 691937, 22970, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t do the photograph justice. The diagonal line leads my eye of the edge.</td>', 'The composition doesn''t do the photograph justice. The diagonal line leads my eye of the edge.', '2008-07-06 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807743, 692252, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think it would have benefited from a high POV such as taken from the top of a latter looking down. That would have put all the focus on what was going on at the same time eliminating the distracting background of cars.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think it would have benefited from a high POV such as taken from the top of a latter looking down. That would have put all the focus on what was going on at the same time eliminating the distracting background of cars.', '2008-07-06 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807746, 693038, 22970, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different POV and larger DOF would have worked better.</td>', 'Maybe a different POV and larger DOF would have worked better.', '2008-07-06 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807747, 693033, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the softness to the picture. Focus, lighting and DOF good.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the softness to the picture. Focus, lighting and DOF good.', '2008-07-06 21:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807754, 693309, 22970, '<td valign="top">Focus, lighting, and composition is good. Nice photograph and the colors complement each other. Nice stock shot</td>', 'Focus, lighting, and composition is good. Nice photograph and the colors complement each other. Nice stock shot', '2008-07-06 22:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807757, 692982, 22970, '<td valign="top">Why the white inside border? I makes the photo look claustrophobic. I think the photo itself it good with nice focus and light but as stated the white border is very distracting.</td>', 'Why the white inside border? I makes the photo look claustrophobic. I think the photo itself it good with nice focus and light but as stated the white border is very distracting.', '2008-07-06 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807765, 693323, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and creativity. I don''t have to tell you whats good about the shot, you know. But a couple of things would have made it better, IMO, since this was under advanced editing. One, there should be not dust bunny out in the middle of the green (clone). And two, the burned highlights could have been reduced with a bit of d/b. <br/>Other than that a well taken shot and concept.</td>', 'Nice setup and creativity. I don''t have to tell you whats good about the shot, you know. But a couple of things would have made it better, IMO, since this was under advanced editing. One, there should be not dust bunny out in the middle of the green (clone). And two, the burned highlights could have been reduced with a bit of d/b. Other than that a well taken shot and concept.', '2008-07-06 22:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807807, 693109, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the highlights from being blown. Nice sculpture.</td>', 'Good job keeping the highlights from being blown. Nice sculpture.', '2008-07-06 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807812, 692251, 22970, '<td valign="top">Those are some large water bottles. Colors are nice.</td>', 'Those are some large water bottles. Colors are nice.', '2008-07-06 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4807815, 692595, 22970, '<td valign="top">A nice moody capture. I get the concept and you did well.</td>', 'A nice moody capture. I get the concept and you did well.', '2008-07-06 22:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
