(4808195, 692993, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know, when I am on the highway, I can always tell when a person from Michigan is sharing the road because they always fly past me (and I don''t drive that slow either!).  So now I suppose that ya''ll up there are training the horses to do the same thing?  hehe  Very cool catch and great comparison between the two modes of transportation.  Congrats on 15th place!</td>', 'You know, when I am on the highway, I can always tell when a person from Michigan is sharing the road because they always fly past me (and I don''t drive that slow either!).  So now I suppose that ya''ll up there are training the horses to do the same thing?  hehe  Very cool catch and great comparison between the two modes of transportation.  Congrats on 15th place!', '2008-07-07 01:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
