(4810717, 691689, 82985, '<td valign="top">So, Blue is the New Green is the Igniter of Controversy!  LOL  This is a great image, very well done (somebody suggests clothing???) and, as I said earlier, I was glad to get to see it.  Given the constraints of the challenge, I suspect it neither deserves 1''s nor 10''s, but I gave it a solid 6, and would have easily gone higher if it had been in the Free Study.  Had your "wrap up your leftovers" comment been the title, it might have been received as a more humorous out of the box approach to the challenge.<br/> <br/>I, too, look forward to more images from you.</td>', 'So, Blue is the New Green is the Igniter of Controversy!  LOL  This is a great image, very well done (somebody suggests clothing???) and, as I said earlier, I was glad to get to see it.  Given the constraints of the challenge, I suspect it neither deserves 1''s nor 10''s, but I gave it a solid 6, and would have easily gone higher if it had been in the Free Study.  Had your "wrap up your leftovers" comment been the title, it might have been received as a more humorous out of the box approach to the challenge. I, too, look forward to more images from you.', '2008-07-08 00:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4810857, 691689, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FocusPoint:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:</b></div><hr/><i> Processing is nice -- almost painterly.  Lighting good.  But DNMC and the subject matter is inappropriate. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Cannot post on forums, but will fess up that I gave this a 1 -- primarily because the clear and unarguable DNMC of the subject matter.  Secondly, it would have gotten a 1 anyway for the nudity involved.  Completely unnecessary.  Again, well processed and taken, but clothe your subject next time.  You have talent, don''t waste it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You''ve got to be kidding me :/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not at all.  DNMC is ALWAYS a 1, as it should be.</td>', 'Originally posted by FocusPoint: Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf: Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf: Processing is nice -- almost painterly.  Lighting good.  But DNMC and the subject matter is inappropriate.   Cannot post on forums, but will fess up that I gave this a 1 -- primarily because the clear and unarguable DNMC of the subject matter.  Secondly, it would have gotten a 1 anyway for the nudity involved.  Completely unnecessary.  Again, well processed and taken, but clothe your subject next time.  You have talent, don''t waste it.   You''ve got to be kidding me :/   Not at all.  DNMC is ALWAYS a 1, as it should be.', '2008-07-08 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
