(4814169, 693164, 59577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by adrian45:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice image - but how did you............?<br/> 1 get the plant in the light bulb<br/> 2 have the bulb at that angle and not fall over<br/> <br/>I am interested, though we don''t see the end of the cap, that gives me a clue, but still would like to know. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Plant was just pushed through neck of bulb and planted with a chopstick.<br/>I used a piece of match on a thread to hold it at that angle. Placed the match in the neck and where you see the metal curve at the end allowed it to be wedged in.</td>', 'Originally posted by adrian45: Very nice image - but how did you............? 1 get the plant in the light bulb 2 have the bulb at that angle and not fall over I am interested, though we don''t see the end of the cap, that gives me a clue, but still would like to know.   Plant was just pushed through neck of bulb and planted with a chopstick.I used a piece of match on a thread to hold it at that angle. Placed the match in the neck and where you see the metal curve at the end allowed it to be wedged in.', '2008-07-09 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
